OL,3,CNew research reveals 'nightmare' of
OL,4,Cfood costs during school summer
OL,5,Cholidays
OL,7,FAs grocery prices and other essential
OL,8,Fcosts go up-and-up this summer, so has
OL,9,Fthe need for charity food services, as
OL,10,FITV News Consumer Editor Chris Choi
OL,11,Freports
OL,13,F"It's a nightmare" was the stark
OL,14,Fphrase from one mum at a Manchester
OL,15,Fcommunity food hub.
OL,17,FLike millions of other parents, the
OL,18,Fsummer brings her extra costs.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@RO]
