OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787093266
OL,3,CNew research reveals 'nightmare' of
OL,4,Cfood costs during school summer
OL,5,Cholidays
OL,7,FKim, a mother of three young children,
OL,8,Ftold us: "You get breakfast, then it's
OL,9,Ftwo minutes later they say 'I'm
OL,10,Fhungry, I'm hungry, I'm hungry', and I
OL,11,Fjust can't feed them quick enough".
OL,13,FNew research shows the sheer scale of
OL,14,Fthe summer slog, as millions of
OL,15,Fparents face extra costs when schools
OL,16,Fare closed.
OL,18,FData from market research firm
OL,19,FWorldPanel suggests 20% of households
OL,20,Fare struggling financially this summer.
OL,26,@pD@JOUsD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
