CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1787093266
OL,3,CNew research reveals 'nightmare' of
OL,4,Cfood costs during school summer
OL,5,Cholidays
OL,7,FAs result, a third of those families
OL,8,Fare avoiding holiday costs such as
OL,9,Ftrips and treats.
OL,11,FSeparate research shows 58% of
OL,12,Ffamilies report more financial
OL,13,Fpressure in summer, with around three
OL,14,Fquarters spending at least an extra
OL,15,F#20 a week on food - according to data
OL,16,Ffrom Felix Community Food.
OL,18,FThe charity's head of community
OL,19,Fengagement, Rachel May, said:
OL,20,F"Families are struggling, they're
OL,21,Fhaving to think can I buy a meal?
OL,26,@|D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
