OL,3,CNew research reveals 'nightmare' of
OL,4,Cfood costs during school summer
OL,5,Cholidays
OL,7,F"Do I pay my rent? Do I pay my
OL,8,Felectricity bill? My water bill?
OL,10,F"It's really really tough out there at
OL,11,Fthe moment."
OL,13,FThe new data comes as experts predict
OL,14,Fthat the summer's record heatwaves
OL,15,Fwill start putting even more pressure
OL,16,Fon food costs.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@LO]
