OL,3,CNew research reveals 'nightmare' of
OL,4,Cfood costs during school summer
OL,5,Cholidays
OL,7,FThe Food and Drink Federation said on
OL,8,FTuesday that "fruit, vegetable and
OL,9,Fgrain supply" are being hit by recent
OL,10,Fheatwaves, with crop shortages set to
OL,11,Ffeed in to supermarket prices.
OL,13,FEconomists from the trade group
OL,14,Fsuggested that this will put upward
OL,15,Fpressure on food inflation going into
OL,16,F2027.
